/*
 * Implements semantic validation for bitwise binary operators in Ymir.
 *
 * Supported operators include:
 *   - bitwise AND, OR, XOR
 *   - bit shifts (<<, >>)
 *   - class-overloaded bitwise operators
 *
 * This module is invoked by BinaryValidation when the operator kind is
 * OperatorType::BITWISE.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::operator::binary::bitwise
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/operator/binary/bitwise.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-04-10
 * @Copyright (C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
